.TH 3DMOUSE-CONFIG 1 2026-11-10 "3dmouse-linux 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
3dmouse-config \- 3DMouse Linux settings application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B 3dmouse-config
.SH DESCRIPTION
A Qt 6 settings application with these pages: overview, device (live axes, 3D cube and buttons),
navigation (speed, curves, per-axis invert and remap, dead zones, calibration), buttons, profiles,
diagnostics and settings (including the overlay position and size, and the optional status icon).
On first start a setup wizard checks the device, desktop, controls and 3D applications; run it again
from Settings.
It talks only to
.BR 3dmouse-agent (1).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B THREEDMOUSE_AGENT_SOCKET
The agent socket path.
.TP
.B SM_GUI_SCREENSHOTS=\fIdir\fR
Render every page to PNG and exit (use with
.BR QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen ).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR 3dmousectl (1),
.BR 3dmouse-osd (1),
.BR 3dmouse-tray (1)
